ive in so many ways. It is double the thickness of The Sovereign, with just 2,750 struck and features a mint mark that only appears on 2018 coins – secure yours today and own a piece of rare minting history. The Royal Mint’s flagship coin, The Sovereign, has featured the portrait of the reigning British monarch for over 200 years, often accompanied by the renowned depiction of St George and the dragon created by The Royal Mint’s own Benedetto Pistrucci. This edition of the gold coin, renowned for its quality and unrivalled accuracy, features a digitally remastered version of Pistrucci’s design to ensure an exact representation of the original engraving. SPECIFICATION Specification Value Denomination Sovereign Maximum Coin Mintage 2750 Alloy 22 Carat Gold Weight 15.97 g Diameter 22.05mm Specification Value Reverse Designer Benedetto Pistrucci Obverse Designer Jody Clark Quality Proof Year 2018 Pure Metal Type Gold"
